codex
The targeted Playwright failure is environmental, not an archive assertion: the repo’s Vite dev server has no API proxy, while the generated client uses relative `/api` URLs. I’m rerunning the same real-user spec against the running FastAPI server, which serves the production frontend build and the API from one origin—the stack mode documented by this repo.
